  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Season the chicken breast with salt, pepper, and turmeric.",
    "Bake the chicken in the oven for 25 minutes or until cooked through.",
    "Meanwhile, blend the aji amarillo peppers, ginger, and sour cream to make the sauce.",
    "Warm the pita bread in the oven for 2 minutes.",
    "Slice the cooked chicken into thin strips.",
    "Assemble the wrap by spreading the aji amarillo sauce on the pita bread, then adding the chicken, cucumber, and red onion.",
    "Fold the pita bread in half to enclose the filling.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy."
